{"result":"{
  "id": "19311",
  "key": "SFCC-816",
  "summary": "Cart Summary Component UI – PWA Kit",
  "description": "As a Developer, I want to build the Cart Summary Component as a PWA Kit component, so that the order totals, checkout actions, duties and taxes messaging, promotion code entry, and product recommendations are displayed consistently on the right-hand side of the cart drawer.\n\nThis is a **PWA Kit UI component story** — it covers the visual build and UI behaviour of the cart summary component only. It does not cover the logic, configuration, or integration behaviour of the elements it contains — these are owned by their respective epics and stories as noted below.\n\n*UI Design Kit:* [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40003106-87796&t=IESHxrB28M8xoKIz-4](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026) \n\nThis is a PWA Kit component story covering the Cart Summary- the right-hand panel of the cart drawer. It acts as a container component that renders the following elements:\n\n- Order Summary - [SFCC-274](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274) \n- Button Group - [SFCC-275](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-275) - note: logic for apple pay / google pay, and functionality will sit in payments\n- Duties and Taxes Text - toggle configuration will be covered in [SFCC-826](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-826) \n- Promotion Code - [SFCC-191](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-191) \n- Recommended for You - [SFCC-815](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-815) \n\n**Image for Reference:**\n\n![\"image-20260826-015151.png\"](image-20260826-015151.png)",
