      "id": "14139",
      "body": "Hi User:600810992b411b0076aaf4cc \nsee comments below:\n\nAC1 - does the discount line need to be accounted for here (where applicable) for example is a legacy VIC is signed in then they will automatically have their 10% VIC discount applied, equally is a promotion code is applied which should be displayed within the order summary.\n\nUser:61f1c44458ce4f006895680f  are retail rewards only applied at checkout? I dont believe they get applied to the cart but I could be wrong. please confirm.\n\nAll other AC’s are reviewed and approved.\n\nBest,\n\nEmma",
