      "id": "14160",
      "body": "Hi User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 - promotions / VIC promotions are not covered in this epic.\n\nFor manually adding promotions, see [SFCC-191 Cart - Promo Code Entry & Validation - Jira](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-191) and [SFCC-192 Discount Line Display Across Cart & Checkout - Jira](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-192)\n\nFor VIC discounts, see [SFCC-645 Customer Group Pricing — Cart Price Rule Display - Jira](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-645)\n\nAnd I haven’t currently scoped Retail Rewards in the cart epic, as my understanding was it’s only checkout.",
